<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-049" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-049-zerong-complete" source-id="s-sanguozhi-049-zerong-complete-ws2075209">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-049-zerong-complete:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　<persName id="c-sanguozhi-049-zerong-complete:p001:m0002" ref="brd_lue_3md">笮融</persName>者，丹楊人。初聚眾數百，往依徐州牧<persName id="c-sanguozhi-049-zerong-complete:p001:m0021" ref="0c6_0ce_a2e">陶謙</persName>。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-049-zerong-complete:p001:m0024" ref="0c6_0ce_a2e">謙</persName>使督廣陵、彭城運漕，遂放縱擅殺，坐斷三郡委輸以自入。乃大起浮圖祠，以銅為人，黃金塗身，衣以錦采，垂銅槃九重，下為重樓閣道，可容三千餘人。悉課讀佛經，令界內及旁郡人有好佛者聽受道，復其他役以招致之，由此遠近前後至者五千餘人戶。每浴佛，多設酒飯，布席於路，經數十里，民人來觀及就食且萬人，費以巨億計。曹公攻<persName id="c-sanguozhi-049-zerong-complete:p001:m0176" ref="0c6_0ce_a2e">陶謙</persName>，徐土騷動，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-049-zerong-complete:p001:m0184" ref="brd_lue_3md">融</persName>將男女數萬口，馬三千匹，走廣陵，廣陵太守<persName id="c-sanguozhi-049-zerong-complete:p001:m0205" ref="5fj_15m_2bb">趙昱</persName>待以賓<persName id="c-sanguozhi-049-zerong-complete:p001:m0210" ref="fzd_d8c_9ya">禮</persName>。先是，彭城相<persName id="c-sanguozhi-049-zerong-complete:p001:m0218" ref="fzd_d8c_9ya">薛禮</persName>為<persName id="c-sanguozhi-049-zerong-complete:p001:m0221" ref="0c6_0ce_a2e">陶謙</persName>所逼，屯秣陵。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-049-zerong-complete:p001:m0230" ref="brd_lue_3md">融</persName>利廣陵之眾，因酒酣殺<persName id="c-sanguozhi-049-zerong-complete:p001:m0241" ref="5fj_15m_2bb">昱</persName>，放兵大略，因載而去。過殺<persName id="c-sanguozhi-049-zerong-complete:p001:m0255" ref="fzd_d8c_9ya">禮</persName>，然後殺<persName id="c-sanguozhi-049-zerong-complete:p001:m0260" ref="g3o_1tg_9lu">皓</persName>。</p>
</text>
